OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,FA passenger travelling on the train
OL,8,Fwhich derailed near Lewes in East
OL,9,FSussex has described how he saw a
OL,10,Fwoman "falling from the sky" as their
OL,11,Ftrain came off the tracks near Lewes
OL,12,Fin East Sussex.
OL,14,FNathan Cole was travelling in the rear
OL,15,Fcarriage of the Southern train when it
OL,16,Fderailed.
OL,18,FThe train came off the tracks near a
OL,19,Ftunnel as it approached Lewes. A major
OL,20,Fincident was declared with multiple
OL,21,Femergency services sent to the scene.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
