OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,FTwo people were seriously injured and
OL,8,Fa total of 20 people are currently in
OL,9,Fhospital being treated.
OL,11,F"I'm looking at the window and I'm
OL,12,Fseeing dirt," Nathan said, speaking to
OL,13,FITV News.
OL,15,F"I'm hoping this window won't bust
OL,16,Fbecause if the window breaks, it's
OL,17,Fgoing right in my face, isn't it?
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,F"So I looked the other way and when I
OL,8,Flooked the other way, I see the woman
OL,9,Fjust right in front of me - she
OL,10,Fliterally just dropped from the sky.
OL,12,F"The left side turned into the sky and
OL,13,Fthen my bit was the ground and then
OL,14,Fwhen the train came to a stop, you
OL,15,Fcould smell the soil just because it
OL,16,Fwas dragging across the soil.
OL,18,F"Eventually a couple of people were
OL,19,Ftrying to wedge the door and finally
OL,20,Fgot it open."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,FFellow passenger Susan has described
OL,8,Fhow the train suddenly picked up
OL,9,Fspeed, leaning on one side before
OL,10,Fcrashing down an embankment.
OL,12,FSusan has told how she was travelling
OL,13,Fin carriage eight of the 2:24 Southern
OL,14,FRailway service from London Victoria
OL,15,Fto Eastbourne on Thursday afternoon
OL,16,Fwhen it derailed.
OL,18,F"I'm just happy to be alive and that
OL,19,Fthere were no fatalities on the
OL,20,Ftrain," she said.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,FSusan who was travelling to Gatwick,
OL,8,Fdescribed the initial journey as
OL,9,F"slow" as passengers were advised that
OL,10,Fthey could apply for a refund due to
OL,11,Fthe length of the journey.
OL,13,F"All of a sudden I saw what I thought
OL,14,Fwas smoke out of the far window - I
OL,15,Fthought the fields were alight, and
OL,16,Fthen suddenly the train picked up
OL,17,Fenormous speed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,F"I could feel it was sort of leaning
OL,8,Fon two wheels, and the next thing, we
OL,9,Fcrashed, and the whole thing rolled
OL,10,Fover."
OL,12,FSusan was helped by emergency rescuers
OL,13,Fto climb out of the carriage - using
OL,14,Fthe guard's door as a roof opening.
OL,16,F"Everybody came and rescued us through
OL,17,Fthat.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786792684
OL,3,CPassenger describes woman 'falling
OL,4,Cfrom the sky' as train derailed near
OL,5,CLewes
OL,7,F"Doctors and nurses and people taking
OL,8,Fmy blood pressures and asking me
OL,9,Fquestions and everybody's a red card.
OL,10,FIt was amazing."
OL,12,FRail bosses have launched a major
OL,13,Finvestigation into what happened and a
OL,14,Fcomplex operation is underway to
OL,15,Fremove the carriages from the scene.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
